name    mines
prog    mines
# Mines: one square marked on the minefield.  Each answer is a single key --
# row, column, then Y to mark -- and marking, not opening, is what keeps this
# repeatable: the field is laid from the clock, and opening H-H hit a mine
# about one run in six, ending the game and leaving the rest of the keys to
# the shell.
rate    0.6
wait    5
keys    H
wait    1
keys    H
wait    1
keys    y
wait    3
snap    field
key     q
wait    3
expect  ##A#B#C#D#E#F#G#H
expect  Markers left: 39
absent  Kabloom
